<title>USA: Okla. Cty ISD 12, Okla. $1.5 mln won by Liberty.</title>
<headline>Okla. Cty ISD 12, Okla. $1.5 mln won by Liberty.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liberty National Bank, Tulsa said it won $1.5 million of Oklahoma Cty Ind Sch Dist No. 12, Okla., combined purpose equipment bonds of 1997.</p>
</text>
